sequenceDiagram
    actor Resp as Responsable coopérative
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant SVC as HarvestService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Resp->>FE: Saisit récolte (cycle, date, quantité, unité)
    FE->>API: POST /api/harvests
    API->>API: StoreHarvestRequest (validation)
    API->>SVC: create(data)
    SVC->>DB: SELECT plot.area_ha FROM crop_cycle join plot
    SVC->>SVC: yield_value = quantity / area_ha
    SVC->>DB: INSERT harvest
    DB-->>SVC: Harvest
    SVC-->>API: HarvestResource
    API-->>FE: 201 Created
